WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:19.010
"Oh no!" Maggie exclaimed. "My shirt is ruined!"

2
00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:24.417
Ms. Wood came over. "Oh dear," she said when she saw Maggie's shirt.

3
00:00:24.418 --> 00:00:26.128
"What happened?"

4
00:00:26.129 --> 00:00:29.810
"Big Spot slobbered on me!" Maggie said.

5
00:00:29.811 --> 00:00:34.158
"Is pony slobber always blue?" Henry asked.

6
00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:36.517
He didn't know much about ponies and horses.

7
00:00:36.518 --> 00:00:39.658
But the blue stain seemed kind of strange.

8
00:00:39.659 --> 00:00:45.138
Maggie scowled at him. "Of course not!" she said.

9
00:00:45.139 --> 00:00:48.162
"Big Spot must have eaten something blue."

10
00:00:48.163 --> 00:00:52.743
"None of our usual horse treats are that color."

11
00:00:52.744 --> 00:00:56.071
Ms. Wood opened Big Spot's mouth to look inside.

12
00:00:56.072 --> 00:01:00.403
She sounded a little worried. "I wonder what he ate."

13
00:01:00.404 --> 00:01:06.912
"I can't wear this shirt in the show," Maggie wailed. "I look ridiculous!"

14
00:01:06.913 --> 00:01:09.427
"Now, Maggie," Ms. Wood said.

15
00:01:09.428 --> 00:01:12.107
"The judge won't be looking at what you're wearing.

16
00:01:12.108 --> 00:01:14.425
She'll be looking at how you're riding."

17
00:01:14.426 --> 00:01:17.826
"Maybe." Maggie didn't sound convinced.

18
00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:21.638
"But I'll still look like a slob in front of everyone!"

19
00:01:21.639 --> 00:01:27.867
"I have an idea, Maggie," Henry said. "Try turning your shirt inside out.

20
00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:30.643
Maybe the stain won't show that way."

21
00:01:30.644 --> 00:01:36.539
Maggie's face brightened instantly. "Henry, you're a genius!" she cried.

22
00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:42.084
"I'll be right back." She ducked behind the stall door.

23
00:01:42.085 --> 00:01:45.237
"Thanks, Henry." Ms. Wood smiled with relief.

24
00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.876
"I think you just saved the day."

25
00:01:47.877 --> 00:01:51.597
Seconds later Maggie emerged with her shirt turned inside out.

26
00:01:51.598 --> 00:01:59.294
"Much better," she said. "Try not to slime this side too, okay, Spot?"

27
00:01:59.295 --> 00:02:01.501
She put on the pony's bridle.

28
00:02:01.502 --> 00:02:04.880
Then she hurried out of the barn leading Big Spot behind her.

29
00:02:04.881 --> 00:02:06.780
Ms. Wood left too.

30
00:02:06.781 --> 00:02:10.282
Henry headed back to the lemonade stand.

31
00:02:10.283 --> 00:02:14.116
"Oh good," Uncle Bruce said when Henry arrived.

32
00:02:14.117 --> 00:02:16.872
"I just saw Maggie getting on her pony."

33
00:02:16.873 --> 00:02:20.700
"Yeah, her class will be starting soon," Henry said.

34
00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:23.594
"Have you seen Cole since I left?"

35
00:02:23.595 --> 00:02:26.737
"No." Uncle Bruce shook his head.

36
00:02:26.738 --> 00:02:30.582
"But I could have used his help. The lemonade stand was pretty busy."

37
00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:33.446
"The next class will begin in three minutes!"

38
00:02:33.447 --> 00:02:36.210
Ms. Wood said over the loudspeaker.

39
00:02:36.211 --> 00:02:40.251
"I want to find a good spot to watch the show," Uncle Bruce told Henry.

40
00:02:40.252 --> 00:02:42.129
"Want to come along?"

41
00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:46.564
"I have to stay with the lemonade stand," Henry said.

42
00:02:46.565 --> 00:02:49.151
"I can watch Maggie from here."

43
00:02:49.152 --> 00:02:52.613
Uncle Bruce nodded and hurried off.

44
00:02:52.614 --> 00:02:56.527
There were no customers at the moment, so Henry sat down to think.

45
00:02:56.528 --> 00:03:00.068
He needed to figure out whether Rebecca was the shirt thief.

46
00:03:00.069 --> 00:03:03.849
He wished Cole was there to help him come up with a plan.

47
00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:07.701
"Where is Cole, anyway?" Henry muttered.

48
00:03:07.702 --> 00:03:12.874
He looked around. He didn't see Cole, but he saw Kira walking by.

49
00:03:12.875 --> 00:03:17.074
She was still wearing her show coat, and her face was red and sweaty.

50
00:03:17.075 --> 00:03:19.357
"Hi," Henry said to her.

51
00:03:19.358 --> 00:03:23.728
"You look hot. Why don't you take off your coat for a while?"

52
00:03:23.729 --> 00:03:28.709
Kira paused. "It's okay," she said. "I'm not that hot."

53
00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:34.636
Henry wondered if she was afraid someone might steal her coat, just like someone had stolen Daisy's shirt.

54
00:03:34.637 --> 00:03:38.442
"Have you seen my friend Cole anywhere?" he asked.

55
00:03:38.443 --> 00:03:40.895
He described what Cole looked like.

56
00:03:40.896 --> 00:03:45.516
"I know who you mean," Kira said. "I saw him earlier.

57
00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:50.765
He was behind the barn helping Daisy wash some mud off her pony's legs with the hose.

58
00:03:50.766 --> 00:03:53.006
That was over an hour ago, though.

59
00:03:53.007 --> 00:03:56.595
Maybe longer. I haven't seen him since then."

60
00:03:56.596 --> 00:04:00.990
She glanced at the ring, where Maggie and the other riders were trotting in a circle.

61
00:04:00.991 --> 00:04:04.772
"Excuse me, I'd better go check on my pony."

62
00:04:04.773 --> 00:04:06.736
She hurried off.

63
00:04:06.737 --> 00:04:11.405
"Well, at least that's one mystery solved." Henry said with a sigh.

64
00:04:11.406 --> 00:04:16.355
Now he knew where Cole had been earlier when Cole was supposed to be looking for napkins.

65
00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:19.982
Too bad that wasn't the mystery Henry was trying to solve!

66
00:04:19.983 --> 00:04:25.292
"Riders, please ask your horses to walk," Ms. Wood said over the loudspeaker.

67
00:04:25.293 --> 00:04:28.106
"The judge is watching you now."

68
00:04:28.107 --> 00:04:32.710
As Henry turned to watch the show class, he saw Cole hurrying toward him.

69
00:04:32.711 --> 00:04:38.156
"Finally!" Henry exclaimed. "Where have you been?"

70
00:04:38.157 --> 00:04:43.738
"Sorry," Cole said breathlessly. "I started to look for clues in the barn.

71
00:04:43.739 --> 00:04:47.088
But then a little kid asked me to help her carry a saddle."

72
00:04:47.089 --> 00:04:51.082
"Well, it took you an awfully long time," Henry said.

73
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:55.479
"Maggie's class is starting," Cole said. "We'd better watch."

74
00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.934
Henry noticed that Rebecca was riding in the class too.

75
00:04:58.935 --> 00:05:03.643
She wasn't riding Coco though. She was riding a different pony.

76
00:05:03.644 --> 00:05:06.637
"Look, there's Rebecca," Henry said.

77
00:05:06.638 --> 00:05:10.605
"We should watch her to see if she does anything suspicious."

78
00:05:10.606 --> 00:05:13.005
"Why?" Cole asked.

79
00:05:13.006 --> 00:05:17.089
Henry realized Cole didn't know that Rebecca was a suspect yet.

80
00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:20.710
Henry told him what had happened between Rebecca and Daisy.

81
00:05:20.711 --> 00:05:25.607
"That's weird," Cole said. "Look! I think the class is finished."

82
00:05:25.608 --> 00:05:28.776
The riders were lining up in front of the judge.

83
00:05:28.777 --> 00:05:33.740
A few moments later, Ms. Wood began announcing the winners.

84
00:05:33.741 --> 00:05:36.743
Soon she got to the final ribbon.

85
00:05:36.744 --> 00:05:46.500
"The first-place ribbon goes to . . . Maggie riding Big Spot!"
